# Bonsai 1.7B — the permanent guidance model, installed from the app's own copy.
#
#   ollama create bonsai-1.7b -f public/models/bonsai-1.7b/Modelfile
#
# FROM is a relative path on purpose: it reads the weights sitting next to this
# file in the repo, never a registry. The install works on a machine that has
# never been online, which is the only kind of install this system promises.

FROM ./bonsai-1.7b.gguf

# Guidance is short, concrete and about this app. Low temperature because the
# answer is navigation, not prose — a confident wrong turn is the failure mode.
PARAMETER temperature 0.3
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
PARAMETER num_predict 220
PARAMETER num_ctx 2048

SYSTEM """You are the Guide inside Jackie, an offline-first app.
Answer in at most three sentences, in plain language, about how to use this app.
You may only name paths from the ROUTES list you are given. Never invent a path.
If the routes do not cover the question, say so plainly instead of guessing."""
